# User-facing: Role, not Persona

**Locked 2026-08-25.** In Companion UI labels, buttons, flash text, and status (Surface + Galaxy 2D + immersive XR), say **Role** — not “Persona”.

| Do | Don’t (user-facing) |
|----|---------------------|
| Role (nav / tab) | Persona |
| Change / Upload / Reset Role | Change Persona |
| Use Role as Live Speech | Use Persona as Live Speech |
| No role yet | No persona yet |
| Push Role to Companion | Push Persona to Companion |

**Keep technical:** `PersonaPlex`, `personaplex`, route id `character`, `personalityContext`, Personality field label, Live Speech.

Policy constants: `COMPANION_UI_ROLE_COPY` in `chat/app/src/lib/companion-settings-2d-policy.ts`  
Full UI lock: `OpenNexus3DStudio/src/moat/companion/UI-UX-COMPANION.md` (gitignored).
